    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26623" root="طرف" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِرَافٌ</span></b>  The <i>portion that is taken</i> [app. meaning
<i>cut</i>] <i>from the extremities</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَطْرَاف</span>) <i>of corn,</i> or
<i>seed-produce.</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَارَثُوا</span>

<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَجْدَ طِرَفًا</span> means <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْ شَرَفٍ</span> [i. e. <i>They inherited,
one after another, glory from nobility of ancestry</i>].
(Ibn-'Abbád, O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرِيفٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And
see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرَفٌ</span>, last sentence but one. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>A tent of
skin,</i> or <i>leather,</i> (S, K, TA,) <i>without a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِفَآء</span>
[q. v., for it is variously explained]; <i>of the tents
of the Arabs of the desert.</i> (TA.)

